 getting arrested by a young detective, Mochizuki Ryota and brought to Yokohama Chuo Police Precinct where he is reunited with his former junior Suzuki and boss Kujira. Kyogoku quickly returns to his position as a detective. However, he cannot comprehend the latest gadgets and the “new wisdom”. He keeps ignoring modern rules without a care and getting Ryota, who has been made his buddy, into trouble.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.9}],"value":7.9,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":7407,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}